<view class="page start-page">
  <view class="intro-card">
    <view class="intro-ic"><view class="ic ic-lg ic-spark"></view></view>
    <view class="intro-title">AI 肝病症状初筛</view>
    <view class="intro-sub">结合健康档案进行多轮问答，给出风险分级、就诊科室与检查方向建议</view>
  </view>

  <view class="block-title">选择就诊人</view>
  <view class="profile-list card">
    <view
      class="profile-item {{selectedId === item.id ? 'active' : ''}}"
      wx:for="{{profiles}}"
      wx:key="id"
      data-id="{{item.id}}"
      bindtap="chooseProfile"
    >
      <view class="p-avatar">{{item.realName[0]}}</view>
      <view class="p-main">
        <view class="p-name">{{item.realName}}</view>
        <view class="p-meta">{{item.relation}} · {{item.gender}} · {{item.age || '?'}}岁</view>
      </view>
      <view class="radio {{selectedId === item.id ? 'on' : ''}}">
        <view wx:if="{{selectedId === item.id}}" class="radio-dot"></view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="add-profile" hover-class="add-hover" bindtap="goCreateProfile">
      <view class="ic ic-sm ic-plus"></view>
      <text>新建档案</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="block-title">描述主要不适</view>
  <view class="complaint-card card">
    <textarea
      class="complaint-input"
      placeholder="例如：最近两周总觉得乏力、没胃口，右上腹隐隐胀痛，皮肤好像有点发黄……"
      placeholder-class="complaint-ph"
      maxlength="500"
      value="{{complaint}}"
      bindinput="onComplaintInput"
    ></textarea>
    <view class="word-count">{{complaint.length}}/500</view>
  </view>

  <view class="tips">
    <view class="tips-title">为得到更准确的建议，请尽量描述：</view>
    <view class="tips-line">
      <view class="tips-dot"></view>
      <text>不适部位、开始时间与持续时长</text>
    </view>
    <view class="tips-line">
      <view class="tips-dot"></view>
      <text>伴随表现（乏力、腹胀、黄疸、尿色加深等）</text>
    </view>
    <view class="tips-line">
      <view class="tips-dot"></view>
      <text>既往乙肝 / 丙肝 / 肝硬化、饮酒史、家族史</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="footer-holder"></view>
  <view class="footer-bar">
    <button class="btn-primary submit-btn" loading="{{submitting}}" bindtap="onSubmit">开始 AI 初筛</button>
    <view class="disclaim disclaimer-mini">初筛结果仅供参考，不能替代医生面诊</view>
  </view>
</view>
